    "extractedText": "\n\n*This is NOT a comp schedule. \n**Comp Schedules and Partnership progams are available upon request\n***Subject to change without notice\nPrimary Core CarriersExample of 10 year ProductsType1st yr compto age\nAmerican LifeAmerican SelectGrowth7.00%74$3 mm - $8,999,999 mm0.25%0.0025\nAmerican Select BonusGrowth7.00%74\nDelaware LifeTruePath IncomeIncome7.00%74$4 mm to $ 8 mm 0.50%0.005\nMomentum GrowthGrowth7.00%75\nF&GSafe Income AdvantageIncome7.00%75$2 mm to $2,999,999 mm0.25%0.0025\nAccumulator Plus 10Growth7.00%75\nGlobal AtlanticIncome 150 + SEIncome7.00%80$3 mm to $6 mm 0.75%0.0075\nForeAccumulation IIGrowth7.00%80\nIBEXISWealthDefenderGrowth7.00%70$2 mm to $4,999,999 mm0.50%0.005\nWealthDefender BonusGrowth7.00%70\nNorth AmericanCharter Plus 10Growth7.00%75$2.5 mm0.50%0.005\nIncome Pay ProIncome7.00%75\nProsperity LifePath ProGrowth7.00%70$500,000 to $999,9990.25%0.0025\nPath Pro MaxGrowth7.00%70\nPartnership program 10 year products",
